Test fixtures - SYNTHETIC DATA ONLY

Everything in this folder is made up for the test suite. Never put real the organisation logs, hostnames,
user names, IP addresses or keys here: this folder is committed to Git.

  synthetic-mixed.log        syslog lines of every parsed family (linux, fortigate, cisco, cef, nginx);
                             used by tests/api.test.js (integration), tests/bench.js and tests/replay.js
  synthetic-m365-test.crt    self-signed certificate + key used only by tests/m365.test.js
  synthetic-m365-test.key

Conventions: hosts test-*, addresses from RFC 5737 (192.0.2.0/24, 198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24) or RFC 1918,
domains *.example. Attack-tool command lines are stored base64-encoded in the .js fixtures because antivirus
quarantines files that contain them in plain text.
